LPL poly4 description

  specification description
    part Vars   of sort list[identifier]
                import identifier list[identifier]
  end

  query    of sort              poly
           result of sort       poly
           import               poly4[Vars]
           start with           (simplify) deriv(1 + 1*X + 2*X*X + 3*X*X*X, X)

end
